# Agent Pack Workflow

## Pipeline Overview

```
packages/agent-pack/src/          → packages/cli/agent-pack-src/
(source of truth — edit directly)    (bundled with CLI — copy to sync)
```

## Sync to CLI

After editing agent pack content, sync to the CLI bundle:
```bash
cp -r packages/agent-pack/src/* packages/cli/agent-pack-src/
```

## Critical Rules

- **ALL content** in `packages/agent-pack/src/` is edited directly (core, modules, recipes, skills, hooks, components)
- **Always sync** changes to `packages/cli/agent-pack-src/` after editing
- The `research/` folder contains reference material (battle-tested apps, libraries) — not synced automatically

## Architecture

```
packages/agent-pack/src/
├── core/           # Always included (principles, patterns, cheatsheet)
├── modules/        # Per-module knowledge (hyperswarm, qvac, etc.)
├── recipes/        # Full implementation guides (p2p-rpc, kv-cache, etc.)
├── skills/         # Thin SKILL.md + resources/ per skill
│   └── <name>/
│       ├── SKILL.md        # ≤100 lines, invokable command
│       └── resources/      # Deep content, loaded on demand
├── hooks/          # Automation
│   ├── skill-rules.json    # Keyword → skill mapping
│   └── auto-format.sh      # PostToolUse formatting
├── components/     # Reusable TypeScript components
│   ├── ai/         # Model manager, chat session, tool runner
│   ├── p2p/        # Swarm manager, replication
│   └── data/       # Corestore, DB setup
```

## Size Budgets

| File Type | Budget | Purpose |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| SKILL.md | ≤4KB | Thin invocation wrapper |
| core/*.md | ≤12KB | Architecture & patterns |
| modules/*.md | ≤8KB | Module overview + quick start |
| recipes/*.md | ≤15KB | Full implementation guides |

## CLI Builder Output

The `buildAgentPack()` function generates tool-specific configs:

- **Claude Code**: Slim CLAUDE.md + `.claude/rules/` (path-scoped) + `.claude/skills/` (with resources) + hooks in settings.json
- **Cursor**: `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` with descriptions + globs for auto-triggering + skill .mdc files
- **OpenCode**: Slim instructions.md + `.opencode/skills/` (with resources) + skill gating in config + custom agents
